    You can send this card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 of those Link
    Monsters; Special Summon it.\r\n\u25CF If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s)
    from the Extra Deck, while this Normal Summoned/Set card is on the field (except
    during the Damage Step): You can send 1 monster from your Deck to the GY."
